// larperCord — Japanese (日本語) interface text.
//
// One entry per line: the English text exactly as it is in the code, then the
// translation:
//
//     "Sign in" "ログイン"
//     "Replying to {s}" "{s}に返信中"
//
// Text that is missing here shows in English. Escapes: \n (new line), \" and \\.
// A long entry can continue on the next line after a trailing \ .
//
// Placeholders ({s}, {d}, {d:.0}...) only matter in text that has them:
//   - copy them exactly as in the English text; they are filled in the same order;
//   - to change the order, write {0}, {1}... instead: {N} is the Nth placeholder
//     of the English text, counting from 0, with its formatting. Don't mix the two;
//   - every value of the English text must appear; {{ and }} are literal braces.
// A translation that breaks these rules shows in English.
//
// The list of texts, what is still missing and a check of this file:
//     python3 tools/i18n_strings.py --check
// To try changes without building, copy this file to larpercord/i18n/ja.kdl in the
// settings folder (~/.config on Linux, %APPDATA% on Windows) and restart the app.
//
// Português: o texto em inglês do código como chave, a tradução ao lado; o que
// falta aparece em inglês. As regras dos marcadores {…} estão acima.

"  [LIVE]" "  [ライブ]"
" (muted)" " (ミュート中)"
" [deaf:srv]" " [サーバースピーカーミュート]"
" [deaf]" " [スピーカーミュート]"
" [mute:srv]" " [サーバーミュート]"
" [mute]" " [ミュート]"
" or " " または "
" · not found" " · 見つかりません"
"#RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA. Applies only to this theme and mode." "#RRGGBB または #RRGGBBAA。このテーマとモードにのみ適用されます。"
"(deleted)" "(削除済)"
"(edited)" "(編集済)"
"(no text)" "(テキストなし)"
"**{s}** added **{s}** to the group." "**{s}**が**{s}**をグループに追加しました。"
"**{s}** changed the channel name to **{s}**." "**{s}**がチャンネル名を**{s}**に変更しました。"
"**{s}** changed the group icon." "**{s}**がグループのアイコンを変更しました。"
"**{s}** followed an announcement channel here." "**{s}**がここでアナウンスチャンネルをフォローしました。"
"**{s}** joined the server." "**{s}**がサーバーに参加しました。"
"**{s}** just boosted the server!" "**{s}**がサーバーをブーストしました！"
"**{s}** just boosted the server! It reached **Level {d}**!" "**{s}**がサーバーをブーストしました！サーバーが**レベル{d}**に到達しました！"
"**{s}** left the group." "**{s}**がグループから退出しました。"
"**{s}** pinned a message to this channel." "**{s}**がこのチャンネルにメッセージをピン留めしました。"
"**{s}** removed **{s}** from the group." "**{s}**が**{s}**をグループから削除しました。"
"**{s}** started a call." "**{s}**が通話を開始しました。"
"**{s}** started a thread: **{s}**" "**{s}**がスレッドを開始しました: **{s}**"
